{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "dd271c08998033c60c0bb463b303d3fb920c191c2e799e9f75720e5bbe63b66d", "ja": "ネコとネコとネコ", "zh": "猫与猫与猫", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1834e9288ffce09ccc43ab3ac3bd33b078421afe9aebe0b87c8eaa2fa95294d4", "ja": "ネコ役に決まった美也は、環のネコのこぶん\nから、ネコらしさを学ぼうと考える。こぶん\nと志保と一緒に、屋上でひなたぼっこを\nする美也。美也は、ネコのようにみんなを\n和ませる、そんな映画にしたいと語る。", "zh": "要演猫的美也，打算跟着环的猫咪小弟\n学习猫咪的一举一动。美也和小弟\n以及志保一起躺在屋顶上晒太阳后，\n她表示希望能拍出一部像猫咪般\n疗愈人心的电影。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1a6ade92117f2ece57a1aefdc4c2b809472e614202b74b1f62f53af808b06e71", "ja": "（今日は日曜だが、公演はない……。そのせいか\n劇場も、どこかのんびりとした空気が流れているな）", "zh": "（今天是周日，但没有安排公演……或许是因为这样，\n剧场的气氛也显得特别悠闲。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "f7d4e1102c780521e4bba8792d8eeb175697d38e97027e0f29d047cade77ecd1", "ja": "む～。どこにいるんでしょうか～？\nお～い、お～い。出てきてください～。", "zh": "唔～跑到哪里去了～？\n喂～喂～快点出来啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6d21cfdff178a50263b17ab821a693051b7189a337486f15179afa99a0d7dc4b", "ja": "お、美也……誰か探してるのか？", "zh": "哦，是美也……她在找谁吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "95ab253eaa3aa160c2f6da9a80912ef2c3a1c972224c17a8dcb62cb8f7368d70", "ja": "お～、{$P$}さん～。\nはい、こぶんちゃんを探しているんです～。", "zh": "哦～{$P$}先生～\n嗯，我在找小弟～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ed63eada0d18308e3b687505822abc1fd91f73fff91e4c6d727f683bbcb9a1d1", "ja": "こぶん……環が飼ってるネコだな。\nいないのか？", "zh": "小弟……是环养的猫对吧。\n牠不在吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "9cfbea5f17adbe79d2046714437ed71b120effa7abd609b343d22cf78b977bb9", "ja": "はい～、そうなんです～。美咲さんに聞いたら、\n朝ごはんは食べに来たみたいなんですけど～。", "zh": "嗯～都没有看到牠～我有去问美咲，\n牠早上有过来吃饭的样子～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1006_p", "source_sha256": "eb5a6d9fca64ff64d3b2b028c0bf7862ee61e94261748b2de7dc2b6b80f549b7", "ja": "そうか。なら、俺も探すのを手伝うよ。\nちょうど、仕事の手が空いたところだしな。", "zh": "这样啊，那我也来帮忙找吧。\n手上正好没有要紧的工作呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "a881b7a8ddae9dd0254d90aefc3b58b11cd59440a18bec2afc60674e72481e84", "ja": "お～、ありがとうございます～。\nこぶんちゃん探しの旅、ですね～。", "zh": "哦～谢谢～\n一起踏上寻找小弟的旅程呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "ab25685f5a71811c18feec02d891fff3444c93f2f2b3e6fadb857b6f22e7babd", "ja": "それでは、行きますよ～。お～♪", "zh": "那么，出发啰～喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "09a39395c17179f6fbcbdbfeffe277332a9e832d13c1704b8934bf4a1be0cef9", "ja": "ふふっ、かわいい。\nよしよし、いい子ね……。", "zh": "呵呵，好可爱。\n好乖好乖，是个乖孩子呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1010_kobun2", "source_sha256": "6f0f299d0926879c2c9b3fe0402f2e450f58ee2cc6a2910a6a058af5b099bbaa", "ja": "にゃー。", "zh": "喵──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "14bc79a09999ec3eaba28af847fe424f2d633a685d04474b98fb6939e026dac7", "ja": "今、ネコの鳴き声が聞こえたような……。\n……あれ、志保？　こぶんも、そこにいたのか。", "zh": "我刚刚好像听到猫叫声……\n……咦？志保？原来小弟也在那啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "ea72041a23acfbc94d31fa12a5f8e13a0827f80d6cc764b3c3ea48a51beac04b", "ja": "おや～？　こぶんちゃん、志保ちゃんと\n遊んでたんですね～。お邪魔でしたか～？", "zh": "哎呀～原来小弟正在跟志保玩呀～\n我是不是打扰你们了～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "b952565d3487b08d046a370eccb4b778678e3ca8cd7405047f0117a57f0cbb7f", "ja": "いえ、別に。\n……それより、どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "没有。\n……话说回来，是有什么事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "9a8b34f074016225e37904880e8db0bff48cb765576de931f903cba08cf2095a", "ja": "実はですね～。今度の映画の台本を読んで、\nどうすればいいか、いろいろ考えていたんです～。", "zh": "其实啊～看完这次的电影剧本以后，\n我一直在思考自己该怎么演才好～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "87ba434f844aceed4c61694ab13b99e5e60185ff589e696c64f333031870e22f", "ja": "私の役は、ちょっぴり不思議なネコさんですから～。\nどうしたら、ネコさんらしさを出せるかな～って……。", "zh": "因为我的角色是有点捉摸不定的猫咪～\n我在想怎样才能演得像一只猫……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "d7bfb3f627bcc759131f212b0f366a0cc2549229bc1495a6497fb7a851d1c4bd", "ja": "ネコらしさ……ですか。", "zh": "演得像只猫……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "14c0ff7dd9493b9658585ba8e4f6f21a3f6067812c8fbf158ecebb7b62a298d3", "ja": "はい～。それで、こぶんちゃんからネコの気持ちを\n教わると、いいんじゃないかと思ったんです～。", "zh": "没错～所以我就想到，跟小弟请教一下\n猫咪在想什么，应该是个不错的办法～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "addaf4f3a14b98efe3e5b5b0bcc3098ae7cbb1153dafd9ed661704547ed95191", "ja": "なるほど……それで美也は、\nこぶんを探していたのか。", "zh": "原来如此……\n所以美也才在找小弟啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "47d47cad931e966c554e29a7cf8340de95a494a0daadc64e0ba9602bf6fe6154", "ja": "ネコの気持ちって、どうやって教わるんだろう……。\nあの、美也さん。私も役作りに参加させてください。", "zh": "要怎样才能体会猫咪的心情呢……\n那个，美也，我也要一起学习将自己代入角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1020_042miy", "source_sha256": "56f249f497531453a5d652873f7fae74ee3b38fae4efda1216b469793500404c", "ja": "お～。志保ちゃん、いいんですか～？", "zh": "哦～志保，你确定吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1021_033sih", "source_sha256": "5f61a33283da48733f839478101a41ec00d452b4b40adf27ffb4336d81667150", "ja": "はい。私もミャオの友達ネコ、\nシッポ役をいただきましたから。", "zh": "嗯，因为我也拿到了志尾，\n这个喵尾的猫朋友的角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "92364658e4f3cf8ffa722fa1eba6d3dde4a3575c736446ac23048da6ecccbb60", "ja": "メインキャストの座は譲りましたけど、\n同じネコ役として、美也さんに負けていられません。", "zh": "主演的位置虽然让给你了，\n但我们一样都演猫，我可不能输给美也。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1023_042miy", "source_sha256": "16f4227ab6354eaeeaa446f30383eff251d6e49dc6bf99d9f88f1c92975c20db", "ja": "むふふ、わかりました～。\nお互いに切磋琢磨して、ネコ役を極めましょう～。", "zh": "呵呵，我知道了～\n就让我们相互切磋，演出完美的猫咪吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1024_p", "source_sha256": "7f682f8ca052b9cb0a405380f5338245c55fa94de497456dc421a0a88e09ca92", "ja": "（今回のネコ役は、ある意味、物語のキーだ。\n美也も志保も、真剣に役作りを考えているんだろう）", "zh": "（这次的猫咪角色，在某种层面上可说是故事的核心。\n我想美也跟志保都很认真在想怎么融入角色。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1025_kobun2", "source_sha256": "6f0f299d0926879c2c9b3fe0402f2e450f58ee2cc6a2910a6a058af5b099bbaa", "ja": "にゃー。", "zh": "喵──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1026_null", "source_sha256": "2d9c2022c2ab3f087f0f635210726af492998d4611b982f922886f052ce5666c", "ja": "トコトコ……。", "zh": "（走走）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1027_p", "source_sha256": "7711cc61f18a5ed82da2992ac72a5369bc5b4756b798ed0bf604f28b59eab984", "ja": "ん？\nふたりとも、こぶんがどこかに歩いていったぞ。", "zh": "嗯？\n你们两个，小弟要走去别的地方啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1028_042miy", "source_sha256": "9578389e65f5a254530a7c3d75c231f4cf6cecad11efee744f2aa6abf94ac41b", "ja": "おや～、どこに行くんでしょう～？\nこぶんちゃんの後をついて行きましょう～。", "zh": "哎呀～牠要上哪去呢～？\n我们跟在小弟后头移动吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1029_033sih", "source_sha256": "83603b2b0493d50facb649e2c44effae22a1ce217b031066ece3cabf6483b21c", "ja": "ええ。行きましょう。", "zh": "嗯，走吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1030_kobun2", "source_sha256": "b56d61b901e99ebce42fd2fab76a193c13bea6e41c76beb6d10e13f2912e4e75", "ja": "ふにゃあ～。", "zh": "呼喵～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1031_033sih", "source_sha256": "96a2cbec605ce24a13ca2da05bc0e8f5150d57176f9384d86c350e7d81ff2167", "ja": "屋上……そう。\nこぶん、ひなたぼっこがしたかったのね。", "zh": "屋顶……\n原来小弟是想晒太阳呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1032_042miy", "source_sha256": "bbce7de45ac8e3304bc3854d4c6b004fa56c672c42cac940c163840339d5d07d", "ja": "ひなたぼっこは、気持ちがいいですからね～。\nでは、私たちも一緒に、ひなたぼっこしますよ～。", "zh": "晒太阳是真的很舒服呢～\n那么，我们也一起晒太阳吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1033_033sih", "source_sha256": "94f1ae3c52d4cc7e2f50509366800be1adfbfe08ea430889dccdc36cce4b639f", "ja": "わかりました。\n……これって、役作りになるんでしょうか？", "zh": "我知道了。\n……这对于融入角色有什么帮助吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1034_p", "source_sha256": "269b0fdea2a7a7c72c33a9f1d02364a9dcd205b683ce786cf51f54d696bbb49c", "ja": "そうだな。ネコになれるかどうかはわからないけど、\n今のこぶんの気持ちはわかるかもな。……ふぁぁ。", "zh": "这个嘛，虽然不能确定是不是真的能变成猫，\n但或许能理解小弟目前在想什么……呼啊啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1035_p", "source_sha256": "be6c868d8e11b8b661f401192315470ee36b2d0fb397cc84f35c258f0079d68d", "ja": "うーん、それにしても本当にいい天気だな。\nひなたぼっこには、もってこいだ。なあ志保……あれ？", "zh": "嗯……话说这天气真是太棒了。\n拿来晒太阳再适合不过了，你说对吧，志保……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1036_033sih", "source_sha256": "992fe8075f323cd9ba73035ee461772ba6151bc461ddcfd387ca7810a1ede682", "ja": "すう……すう……。", "zh": "呼……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1037_kobun2", "source_sha256": "e3dd960d07fe6c47cdc034898942b9e7af747255ebd0a44def493b53ee0273db", "ja": "すー……すー……。", "zh": "呼……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1038_042miy", "source_sha256": "75e3dc8bbdcc01814ed9b670c5be086314210622c67866ba3b4c7613b7659552", "ja": "ふふふ。\n志保ちゃん、眠ってしまいましたね。", "zh": "呵呵呵，\n志保睡着了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1039_p", "source_sha256": "03ed6a0f6653929b952dd2ef8a3c7efd90780c29b64bcf207252c0fd74417f1d", "ja": "そうだな。風邪をひくといけないから、\n上着を掛けておくとするか……。", "zh": "对啊，要是感冒就糟了，\n帮她披个外套吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1040_042miy", "source_sha256": "e9f727b365e318bfe75f52e5c1fbcb3de9774ae132a9b0baa29123cb2d3e6542", "ja": "志保ちゃんとこぶんちゃん、仲良しですね～。\nネコさんみたいですよ～。", "zh": "志保跟小弟的感情真好～\n就像真的猫咪一样呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1041_p", "source_sha256": "d52ab6713e5df93d50b58f5aed3ab736eb9291129385f788f3d5ab3f1097e632", "ja": "いや、片方は本当にネコだしな。……それで、\n美也の方はどうだ？　ネコの気持ちはわかりそうか？", "zh": "呃，其中一个真的就是猫咪……那么，\n美也你这边如何？可以理解猫在想什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1042_042miy", "source_sha256": "fcf8f2edc6f35f17e481050df8f0aa9a8217fb96ff35351f38f27df1357a56a7", "ja": "む～ん、そうですね～。\n難しいかもしれませんけど～……。", "zh": "嗯～这个嘛～\n好像有点难……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1043_042miy", "source_sha256": "9f3c82a5ede7aa48b5c6cf783eb0a6657a69bb5767b89a4d32a44ce5dbb6f343", "ja": "でも、ひとつ素敵なことがわかりました～。ネコさんは\nみんなを和ませることができるみたいです～。", "zh": "不过，我知道了一件很棒的事情～\n那就是猫咪好像可以疗愈人心～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1044_p", "source_sha256": "d551d7824d96a2f28c338133882ebaa79342817ab9345ad67e323950a63b14cb", "ja": "ネコはみんなを和ませる……か。\nうん、確かにそうかもしれないな。", "zh": "猫咪可以疗愈人心……\n嗯，或许就是如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1045_042miy", "source_sha256": "2ec156f48ed88c3d0bb67f1c6960befb637634fbccd390d7bf676942f8ee2828", "ja": "三姉妹の喫茶店も、近所に住むお客さんたちが、\nホッと一息つきにくる……そんなお店ですよね～。", "zh": "三姊妹的咖啡厅，也能让住在附近的客人们，\n在繁忙之余喘口气……是这样的店对吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1046_042miy", "source_sha256": "2cf14a644dcabd4362fb28dea8687bfe37ca81cfb277c0b117806466bd30c3d4", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n私、決めましたよ～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n我决定了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1047_p", "source_sha256": "d0df57868d313d5aa9b80af19cefcab5b58c2c59f8faa0730046961a04daa21a", "ja": "決めた……って、何をだ？", "zh": "决定了……决定什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1048_042miy", "source_sha256": "0c6c74209e09e28546e8dadc34d9e7ec352b0aabd1d85102fb3b70fa1d7af4aa", "ja": "はい～。見た人も、出演する私たちも。みんなが\n仲良く笑顔になれる、そんな映画にしたいんです～。", "zh": "嗯～我想拍一部能让观众，还有参与演出的我们，\n所有人都能和乐融融、面带笑容的电影～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1049_p", "source_sha256": "9a50301c5969a5019581b6fb29086c0dacfd80e8cb484f4f6f9e7404051f6b54", "ja": "そうか。うん、いいんじゃないかな。\n楽しみにしてるよ。", "zh": "这样啊，嗯，我觉得挺不错的。\n我很期待喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1050_042miy", "source_sha256": "1a5fc50481095609b5d069817b1307ce6d1869c9aeb6b76740b8034b7fe6c2a9", "ja": "はい～、頑張りますよ～。むふふ♪", "zh": "好～我会加油的～呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1051_033sih", "source_sha256": "89bf4e18648165b198fbd28fb85a08d7ddb2da7989ca5af2536941a123bcaf5b", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n……{$P$}さん、起きてください。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n{$P$}先生，请起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1052_p", "source_sha256": "e352f7f99d87d554c540d23982013e1be486caf8c5a4bc0401192c46d6c6a470", "ja": "うん……おっと、いつの間にか寝ちゃってたのか。\n起こしてくれてありがとう、志保。", "zh": "嗯……哎呀，我不知不觉间睡着了。\n谢谢你叫我起来，志保。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1053_033sih", "source_sha256": "10932db71d79b9e68f2bfbdd4116c2b79f8872712ef340e0f0fba1f0c20a6a19", "ja": "いえ。……{$P$}さんに\n風邪をひかれたら、困りますので。", "zh": "不会……要是{$P$}先生\n感冒了，我会很伤脑筋的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1054_p", "source_sha256": "caab5d7ad885a2016ab2082def81b2e9b1ee23a34e0515d61bd0fd3cc1b9a50e", "ja": "はは、そうだな。上着、返してくれてありがとう。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。然后，谢谢你还我外套。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1055_042miy", "source_sha256": "e3dd960d07fe6c47cdc034898942b9e7af747255ebd0a44def493b53ee0273db", "ja": "すー……すー……。", "zh": "呼……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1056_p", "source_sha256": "c18afb85e0f5da1b3d350ad2900802b0694e55a6899dcb16ce64bd7d5ae08013", "ja": "あれ、美也も寝ちゃったのか……。\nおーい美也、そろそろ起きよう。風邪ひくぞ。", "zh": "奇怪，美也也睡着了呀……\n喂～美也，该起床啰，会感冒的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1057_042miy", "source_sha256": "89e3a58441d0ea42572550ddc46e160fc2b865cc261521b16586132bd988c583", "ja": "ん～……。あ、{$P$}さん、\n志保ちゃん……おはようございます～。", "zh": "嗯……啊，{$P$}先生，\n还有志保……早安～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1058_p", "source_sha256": "ca28942252a771227ae32db21dbb38a62a6a7de69181e90c1692b3904c90dd90", "ja": "ああ、おはよう。", "zh": "嗯，早安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1059_033sih", "source_sha256": "3fd3686440254142a9b1191a6c4726dab1af162a7ff606d46bb6e14f3b54a25b", "ja": "おはようございます。\n……もう、午後ですけどね。", "zh": "早安。\n……虽然已经下午了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1060_kobun2", "source_sha256": "71eca67006f0ee4659120dbf12faa14f7ea959a5acf98d75e6bbf55c82e7c58e", "ja": "にゃーあ。", "zh": "喵──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1061_p", "source_sha256": "adeb413dfee6c428a3af3d95f72ee08577e7b7afb88eb398b9654d67d1cabdef", "ja": "おっと、こぶんも起こしちゃったか。\nおはよう、こぶん。", "zh": "哎呀，不小心把小弟也叫醒了。\n早啊，小弟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1062_042miy", "source_sha256": "917209edd553b5c0f77f58f5c9a850b317d9ee01023b4f48af8690b1dc8af5d8", "ja": "今日は、とってもいい日曜日でした～。\nネコさんの気持ちが、わかりましたよ～。", "zh": "今天真是舒服的周日～\n我明白猫咪在想什么了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1063_p", "source_sha256": "1acecea67d9b86763fb653b0b732977885a8786581b829f0ef845b223fd3e08f", "ja": "結局、ひなたぼっこして寝てただけな気もするが……。\n役作りに繋がったなら良かった。志保はどうだ？", "zh": "感觉就只是晒太阳睡个觉而已……\n但有帮助你们融入角色就好。志保呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1064_033sih", "source_sha256": "ae176568e60c86bc16f2494c50a1f960c2581322d3f3e3c8ad29afe2e7a0eac0", "ja": "私も、間近でネコを観察することで\nいい勉強になりました。", "zh": "我也是，这样近距离观察猫咪，\n让我学到了不少。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1065_033sih", "source_sha256": "d0d7bbfa07eb4029e296c7b7c18a523d28c182c1c068f1687062bfd435da9c62", "ja": "……な、なんですか。本当ですよ。", "zh": "……怎、怎么了？我是说真的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1066_042miy", "source_sha256": "2dbf30c08b39bf81123e9594e0f1e97c6eab836b9134020468bc6245dba72ab7", "ja": "むふふ。どんな映画になるか、楽しみですな～。\n志保ちゃん、撮影、がんばりましょうね～。", "zh": "呵呵，真期待最后会拍出怎样的电影呢～\n志保，到时候开拍一起加油～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1067_033sih", "source_sha256": "2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55", "ja": "はい。", "zh": "好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0054_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_03_1068_p", "source_sha256": "1d43003b0778add4afc1e1435a69c415d7a03bf63ca7f6465ad9d13e094d76d5", "ja": "（美也も志保も、やる気は十分だ。\nあとは……ネコらしく、のんびり演じてもらおう！）", "zh": "（美也和志保都十分有干劲。\n剩下就是……像只猫，悠悠哉哉地演出来！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
